  m_Name: Heavenly Burgers
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArticlePageData
  helperWasUsedOnThisArticleState: 0
  articleID: https://NewManilaCityShelter/AboutUs
  title: Heavenly Burgers
  bodyText: "Our Core Principle: All you need is one good one !\r\nIn an era of gimmicky
    flash sales, bulk discount buckets, and \"Buy X, Get X\" promos, Seraphim Sliders
    takes a deliberate, uncompromising stand. We do not, and will never, run multi-buy
    discount deals.\r\nHeavenly Burger\u2019s founding philosophy rests on a fundamental
    belief: One slider, built perfectly, served fresh to one customer at a time.\r\n\"The
    moment a kitchen starts trying to pump out more than one burger for the price
    of one, quality collapses. Buns get soggy, patties sit under warmers, line cooks
    get burned out, and the customer receives an inferior product. We refuse to compromise
    our integrity just to move volume. Every slider that leaves our line is a masterpiece
    meant to be enjoyed fresh off the grill. We price our menu fairly for the premium
    ingredients we use, and we treat every single burger, and every single customer,
    with the same individual care.\"\r\n\u2014 Chef Leo Santos, Founder & Head Chef\r\nWe
    don't do gimmicks, and we don't treat our food like commodity fast food. When
    you sit at our counter, you are paying for uncompromised quality, craft, and
    care in every bite."
  headliner: <b>Get Three Sliders for the Price of One this Weekend !</b>
  hasExternalLink: 1
  customComments:
  - "Wait, I thought they didn\u2019t do these types of deals ?"
  - Is this for real ? ill go if it is.
  - Does it come with egg roll ?
